  "rationale": "41 units of Butter 200G at Outlet 06 (East Bengaluru) are projected unsold before the expiry deadline on 2026-09-23; doing nothing writes off ₹6718 and a blanket 20% markdown costs ₹10343. This play uses a bundle with SKU-MULTIGRAIN-BREAD-400G at ₹250 for 207 consented customers (Dairy occasionals, Everyday staples shoppers, Sweets occasionals, Festival sweets loyalists): expected 20 units, margin ₹424, discount cost ₹611, waste avoided ₹3336 (CI 1 to 59 units; prior n 20, measured n 0). Policy v1: \"2. Prefer bundles and transfers over blanket markdowns; markdowns are the last lever.\" This bundle play pairs Butter 200G with Multigrain Bread 400G at a price of 250 INR, satisfying the 8% margin floor for dairy while avoiding 3335.99 INR in waste. It targets high-affinity dairy, staples, and sweets segments, aligning with the policy preference for bundles over markdowns.",
